<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tanjong cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tanjong cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Hatim Hoosenally has cut his rating for Malaysian gambling company Tanjong Plc to market underperformer from buy.</p>
<p>-- He wrote in an April 23 report that tough competition would slow earnings growth. &quot;The stock's valuation looks demanding ... given slow projected earnings growth.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
